<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt1">NEHEMIA</para>
  <para style="imt">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Nehemia na Ezra chotulongela apfila Waisiraeli pfawalekelighwe woye kuna isi ya Isiraeli kulawa akula kuna isi tsa mhamo tsa uajemi na Babeli. Nehemia kutulongela apfila ubanda utsunguluke Yerusalemu pfautsengighwe keli. Iwanu wengi iwasomile wotoghola ghendo ka Ezra yuyo iyandike ichitabu cha mwanduso na chakeli cha Ighalawile Mmatsuwa, na yuyo iyandike ichitabbu cha Ezra na cha Nehemia. Na ka si yeye Ezra baye, munu yungi yuyo iyapfandike ipfitabu apfino. Ichitabu cha Nehemia chakoneka chandikighwa mna imiyaka ya elufu nne na salasini ng'ana Yesu yoneke baye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nehemia tsa munu iyang'ali yomwing'agha idipfai mfalume Aritashasta wa Uajemi. Kamlomba mfalume ayo yamleke yoye Yerusalemu yakautsenge keli ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Mfalume Aritashasta kamtogholela Nehemia yatende apfo, na hambele kamsaghula yawe mkulu wa isi ya Yuda, isi itsunguluka ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu (5.14). Hata ka wanu wamwenga tsawabama kumghoma Nehemia yaleke kuutsenga keli ubanda wa Yerusalemu, lekeni Imulungu kamwapfila Nehemia na ubanda utsengighwa kwa matsuwa hamsini na meli. Kuya Ezra kamwapfila Nehemia kuwalongotsa Waisiraeli woyile keli lilaghano lyawo na Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Isura ya mwanduso mbaka ya sita tsotulongela apfila Nehemia pfayoyile Yerusalemu na pfayalongotse ing'onde ya kuutsenga keli ubanda wa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isura saba mbaka ya kumi na ndatu yotulongela apfila Waisiraeli pfawanzile kukala Yerusalemu na kuwinza keli ghamalaghitsom gha Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kolomba yatogholighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Ghamalonga ghayalongile Nehemia imwana wa Hakalia. Ikala ghumwetsi ighukemighwa Kisileu, mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini ghwa ukutawa kwa mfalume Atashasta, hanikalile mna ingome ya ghumji ghwa Shushani, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />ndughu yangu yumwe iyakemighwe Hanani kanyangila, yeye na wanu wamwenga iwolawa Yuda, na nene niwaghutsa mbuli tsa Wayahudi iwakalile, na awala iwoyile kulawa kuna utumwa, pfipfila niwaghutsa mbuli tsa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Nawo wanyidika walonga, “Iwanu iwakalile wagima mna isi aila, na awala iwoyile kulawa kuna utumwa, sambi wamna maghayo makulu, na wamna ichinyala, na ubanda wa Yerusalemu ubomolighwa, na ghamalango ghake ghalakatsighwa na ghumoto.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Na nene hanihulike tsimbuli atso nikala hasi, nilila, nidomboketsa kwa matsuwa mengi, na nene ning'ali nifunga ukuja, na kumlomba Imulungu wa kulanga: <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />nilonga, “Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wa kulanga, ghweghwe yauli Imulungu mkulu na iyopfukighwa ng'ani, iyotimilitsa lilaghano lyake na uluso wake ung'aumala baye kwa awala iwomkunda na iwokinda ghamalaghitso ghake, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />uwambe lighutwi lyako, na tsinenge tsako tsifumbuke, utegheletse achila chanikulomba nene nimtumighwa wako, chilo na misi haniwalombela iwatumighwa wako, iwanu wa Isiraeli. Noungama tsinzambi tsa iwanu wa Isiraeli, tsatutendile hambele hako, nene na ing'anda ya aba wangu tutenda nzambi. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Tukutendela pfihile ng'ani, na tuleka kukinda imiko, na tsisheria, na ghamalamtsi ghaumlaghitse Musa, imtumighwa wako. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Nokulomba, ulikumbuke lilonga alila lyaumlaghitse Musa, imtumighwa wako, ahala haulongile, ‘Ka ng'amtsakuwa wanu wa kutogholeka baye, nitsowapwililisa kuna iwanu wa isi tsingi, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />lekeni mng'ambuyila nene, na kutsikinda tsiamri tsangu, na kutsitenda, hata ka iwanu wenu wamna isi ya utumwa ili kutali ghendo kwaitsighila isi, nene nitsoweka hamwe, na kuwoyitsa hanu ahala hanisaghule wanitambikile.’ <verse eid="NEH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, lola, awano watumighwa wako, na iwanu wako, yauwakombole kwa tsingupfu tsako nyingi, na kwa ghumoko ghwako ghuna ingupfu. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Nokudedetsa, de de! Ghwe MNDEWA, lighutwi lyako litegheletse achila chanilomba nimtumighwa wako, na aghala ghawolomba watumighwa wako, iwodeng'elela ukukupfuka, na unitendele uluso nene mtumighwa wako leloli, nitogholighwe hambele ha imunu ayuno.” Mana tsa ning'ali nitenda isang'ano ya ukumwing'agha mfalume idipfai.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia koghenda Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Ikala Ghumwetsi ighukemighwa Nisani, mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini ghwa ukutawala kwake mfalume Aritashasta, ahala idipfai haikighwe hambele hake, niisola idipfai aila nimwing'a mfalume, aku nakoneka nina hutsuni ng'ulu, na tsasina mboneke apfo baye hambele hake. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Apfo mfalume kanilongela, “Hebali ichihanga chako chakoneka chising'inika, naghwe ng'uli mtamu baye? Nakona ghweghwe kuna hutsuni ng'ulu mmoyo mwako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Baho nipfuka ng'ani. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Na nene nimlongela mfalume, “Ghwe mfalume, Imulungu yakwike! Hebali ichihanga changu tsachileke koneka china hutsuni, akuno ghumji ghuna ghamakabuli ghawatsikighwe sekulu tsangu ghwa mna uchuwa, na ghamalango ghake ghalakatsighwa na ghumoto?” <verse eid="NEH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Naye mfalume kanilongela, “Lelo choni chubama nikutendele?” Baho nimlomba Imulungu wa kulanga mmoyo mwangu, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />kuya nimlongela mfalume apfino, “Ka pfikunoghela, ghwe mfalume, na ka ghweghwe konitogholela nene mtumighwa inili hambele hako, nokulomba unitume nighende Yuda, kuna ghumji ghwa ghamakubuli gha sekulu tsangu, nikaghutsenge ghoya keli.” <verse eid="NEH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Naye mfalume kanilongela, akuno malikia kakala kahabehi naye, “Ghumwanza ghwako ghutsosola matsuwa mangapi, naghwe utsakuya tsuwachi?” Apfo mfalume kona pfinogha ukunileka mbuke, na nene nimlongela nitsakuya tsuwachi. <verse eid="NEH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Pfipfila nimlongela mfalume, “Ka kwakona pfinogha, ghwe mfalume, ungaye tsibaluwa nikaweng'e iwakulu wa isi tsili kumwambu mwa ghumto Eufurati, wakanilekelele nibite mbaka nipfike kuna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Pfipfila nokulomba umwandikile ibaluwa Asafu, ayula iyokalitsa ghumhulo ghwa mfalume, umlongele yangaye imibiki ya ukutengenetsa ghamalango gha ubanda ya ing'anda ya Imulungu, na ghamalango gha ubanda wa ghumji, na gha ghamalango ing'anda yanitsakwingila nikale.” Naye mfalume kangaya chila chinu chanibamile, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wangu tsakahamwe na nene. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Mfalume kangaya iwakulu wa maasikali na wadinafalasi nighende nawo. Nighenda nipfika kwa iwakulu wa isi tsili kumwambu mwa ghumto Eufurati, na niweng'a tsibaluwa tsilawile kwa mfalume. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Lekeni Sanibalati iyolawa mna ghumji ghwa Horoni, na Tobia, ichilongotsi wa Waamoni, hawahulike katsa munu kuwatendela ighanoghile iwanu wa Isiraeli, imbuli ayo iwadesa sideke.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Apfo nipfika Yerusalemu na nikala ako kwa matsuwa madatu, <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />kuya nilawa nechilo, nene na wanu chidogho, tsasimlongele munu wowose baye achila Imulungu chayekile mna ghumoyo ghwangu, cha ukughutendela ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Wala sighendile na mnyama yungi baye, ila ichihongwe ayula yanimdinile nene. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Baho hachilo, nibitila Lilango lya kulwanda, niwinza inzila ighenda kuna Ichisima cha Litsoka, na kuna Lilango lya Tsalala, niikaghula imibanda ya Yerusalemu, ibomolighwe, na ghamalango ghake, ighalakatsighwe na ghumoto. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Kuya nighenda akula kuna Lilango lya Imbwibwi, na kuna Tsimbu lya Mfalume, lekeni ng'ahakalile na hanu baye ha ukubita ichihongwe ayula yanimdinile. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Apfo nigheluka chilo chicho mmbalimbali mwa ilukolongo, niukaghula ubanda. Kuya nihunduka kuchughu, nyingila keli mna ghumji kubitila Lilango lya Kulwanda. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Nawo iwakulu ng'awamanyile baye kwani kwanighendile, na choni chaning'ali nitenda, kwaapfila tsasina niwalongele baye Wayahudi, wala iwatambika, wala wapfilongotsi, wala iwakulu, wala iwanu iwobamighwa kusang'ana ing'onde ayo. <verse eid="NEH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Kuya niwalongela, “Mwakona pfatughaya! Mwoyona Yerusalaemu pfaili uchuwa, na ghamalango ghake pfaghalakatsighwe na ghumoto. Lelo mtse, tuutsenge keli ubanda wa Yerusalemu, ili tuleke kughendelela kuwa mna ichinyala achino.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Niwalongela apfila Imulungu wangu pfayanitendele uluso, na achila mfalume chayanilongele. Nawo walonga, “Haya! Tukeni tukatsenge keli.” Apfo nawo wandusa isang'ano ayo inoghile. <verse eid="NEH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Lekeni Sanibalati, iyolawa mna ghumji ghwa Horoni, na Tobia, chiongots Muamoni, na Geshemu, Mwarabu, hawahulike, wang'ong'a na kutuseka, na watubetsa ghendo, walonga, “Angu mwemwe, chinu chachi achino chamtenda? Pfihi mwombiduka mfalume?” <verse eid="NEH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Baho niwedika nilonga, “Imulungu wa kulanga, yeye katsotwapfila tuisang'ane ghoya ing'onde aino, na twetwe iwatumighwa wake tutsakwinuka na tutsoutsenga, lekeni mwemwe ng'amna chenu baye ahano Yerusalemu, wala ng'ahana haki yenu baye, wala chinu cha kukumbukighwa.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Ubanda wa Yerusalemu wotsengighwa keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Apfo Eliashibu, imtambika mkulu, hamwe na ndughu tsake iwatambika, waghenda kutsenga keli Lilango lya Wang'olo, walitenda lyele, weka imilango yake, na waghendelela kutsenga mbaka kuna ghumnala ghwa Mia Imwe, nagho pfipfila waghwika kwa Imulungu a watsenga keli mbaka kwaghuli ghumnala ghwa Hananeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Na hayalawile yeye watsenga iwanu wa Yeriko, na hawalawile iwanu wa Yeriko, katsenga Zakuri imwana wa Imri. <verse eid="NEH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Na Lilango lya Somba, litsengighwa keli na iwana wa Senaa, watengenetsa imighamba ya chuma na waimisa imilango yake na ghamakomeo ghake. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Hawatsighile awo, katsenga Meremoti imwana wa Uria, na mtsukulu wa Hakozi. Hayalawile ayo, katsenga Meshulamu imwana wa Berekia, na mtsukulu wa Meshezabeli. Kuya Sadoki, imwana wa Baana naye katsenga. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Hayatsighile Sadoki watsenga iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Tekoa, lekeni pfilongotsi wao walema ghendo ukusang'ana ing'onde yaweng'ighwe na iwakulu wao.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Na Lilango lya Ghumwande litsengighwa keli na Yoyada, imwana wa Pasea, na Meshulamu imwana wa Besodeiya, watengenetsa imighamba yake, weka imilango yake, ghamakomeo, na tsimalamingo tsake. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Hawatsighile awo, iwatsengile keli tsa Melatia, iyolawa mna ghumji ghwa Gibeoni, na Yadoni iyolawa mna ghumji ghwa Meronoti, na iwanu wa Gibeoni, na wa Mispa, awo tsawalongotsighwa na imkulu wa ghumkoa ighuli kumwambu mwa ghumto Eufurati. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Hawatsighile iwanu awo, kautsenga Uzieli, imwana wa Harihaiya, yumwe wa mafundi wa nzahabu. Na hayamalitse yeye, katsenga keli Hanania, yumwe wa mafundi iwotengenetsa ghamapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya. Nawo waghutsenga keli ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mbaka ghupfika hana Ubanda Mghatsi. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Kuya hawatsighile wawo, katsenga Refaiya, imwana wa Huri, imkulu wa inusu ya ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Hayatsighile yeye, Yedaya, imwana wa Harumafu, katsenga keli ubanda hanu ihelolesa na ing'anda yake. Kuya katsa Hatushi, imwana wa Hashabineia, katsenga hanu hawinzile. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Naye Malikiya, imwana wa Harimu, na Hashubu, imwana wa Pahati Moabu, watsenga keli hanu hawinzile, na watsenga Ghumnala ghwa Ghamatanulu. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Kulawa aho, iyatsengile keli Shalumu imwana wa Haloheshi, iyang'ali yolongotsa nusu ya ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, yeye katsenga aku neghe tsake womwapfila. <verse eid="NEH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Lilango lya Kulwanda litsengighwa keli na Hanuni, na iwanu iwokala Zanoa, walitsenga, wemisa imilango yake, weka ghamakomeo ghake, na tsimalamingo tsa ukuhindila, na wautsenga keli ubanda kwa utali wa futi elufu imwe na miya tano, mbaka upfika kwalili Lilango lya Tsalala. <verse eid="NEH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Lekeni Lilango lya Tsalala litsengighwa keli na Malikiya, imwana wa Rekabu, mkulu wa isi ya Beti Hakeremu, kalitsenga, kemisa imilango yake, keka ghamakomeo ghake, na tsimalamingo tsake tsa ukuhindilia. <verse eid="NEH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Na Lilango lya Imbwibwi litsengighwa keli na Shalumu, imwana wa Kolihoze, imkulu wa wilaya ya Mispa, kalitsenga keli, katima ichiswili hanu aho, kemisa imilango yake, keka ghamakomeo ghake, na tsimalamingo tsake tsa ukuhindilia. Na katsenga ubanda wa Tsimbu lya Siloamu lili habehi na ibostani ya mfalume, mbaka kuna tsingatsi itsihulumka kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />hayatsighile yeye, katsenga keli Nehemia, imwana wa Azibuki, mkulu wa nusu ya wilaya ya Beti Zuri, katsenga mbaka hanu helolesa na ghamakaburi gha Daudi, na mbaka litsimbu litengenetsighwe, na mbaka kuna ing'anda ya maaskiali wana ingupfu.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi iwatsengile Ubanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Hayatsighile Nehemia, watsa Walawi kuutsenga keli ubanda: Kanza Rehumu imwana wa Bani, kuya Hashabia, mkulu wa nusu imwe ya wilaya ya Keila, yeye kawatsengela keli ubanda iwanu wa wilaya yake. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Na hayatsighile yeye, watsenga ndughu tsawo, iwalongotsighwe na Bavai, imwana wa Henadadi, mkulu wa nusu ya kabili ya wilaya ya Keila. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Kuya katsenga keli Ezeri, imwana wa Yeshua, mkulu wa Mispa, hanu hangi henuke helolesa na ing'anda ya ukwikila tsisilaha, ahala hana ikona ya ubanda. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Kuya Baruki, imwana wa Zabai, keyunda ghendo, katsenga keli hanu hangi, kulawa ahala hana ikona ya ubanda mbaka hanu ha ukwingilila kuna ing'anda ya mtambika mkulu Eliashibu. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Hayatsighile yeye, Melemoti mwanaghe Uria, na mtsukulu wa Hakozi, katsenga keli hanu hangi kulawa hana lilango lya ing'anda ya Eliashibu mbaka kwaitsighile ing'anda ya Eliashibu.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatambika iwatsengile Ubanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Hayatsighile, watsenga keli iwatambika, iwang'ali wokala habehibehi na ghumji. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Kulawa wawo Benjamini na Hashubu watsenga keli hanu helolesa na tsing'anda tsawo. Na kulawa wawo Azaria mwana wa Maaseiya, na mtsukulu wa Anania, katsenga keli habehi na ing'anda yake. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Hayatsighile, Binui, imwana wa Henadadi naye katsenga keli hanu hangi, kanzila hana ing'anda ya Azaria mbaka ubanda hauhunduka, na mbaka hana imembe. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />yatsighile yeye, hanu hangi hatsengighwa keli na Palali, mwana wa Uzai, kulawa ahala haupindile ubanda, na ghumnala ighulawilila uchanya, kuna ing'anda ya hachanya ya mfalume, habehi na ichibwalu cha iwabetetsi. Kulawa yeye, Pedaya imwana wa Paroshi, <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />hamwe na iwatumighwa wa ing'anda ya Imulungu, iwang'ali wokala mna ichidunda cha Ofeli, watsenga keli hanu helelosa na Lilango lya Ghamatsi, lili ubali wa Mashariki, na ubali wa ghumnala mtali ighulawilila uchanya.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wangi iwatsengile keli ubanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Kulawa wawo, iwanu wa Tekoa watsenga lwakeli hanu hangi, helolesa na ghumnala mkulu mtali, mbaka kwauli ubanda wa Ofeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Na kulawa hachanya ha Lilango lya Wafalasi watsenga keli iwatambika, chila yumwe katsenga hanu helolesa na ing'anda yake. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Kulawa awo, Zadoki imwana wa Imeri, katsenga lwakeli hanu hangi helolesa na ing'anda yake. Na kulawa yeye, katsenga keli hanu hangi Shemaya mwana wa Shekania, iyobetetsa Lilango lya Mashaliki. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Hayalawile yeye, Hanania mwana wa Shelemia, na Hanuni imwana wa sita wa Zalafu, watsenga hamwe hanu hangi. Kuya Meshalumu mwana wa Barekiya katsenga keli hanu hangi helelosa na ichiheleto chake. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Kulawa yeye, Malikiya, mwana wa iyotengenetsa pfinu pfa nzahabu, katsenga keli hanu hangi mbaka ing'anda yawokala iwatumighwa wa ing'anda ya Imulungu na ya wachulutsi, ilolesa na Lilango lya Ukaghutsi, na mbaka kuna ichiheleto cha kuchiswili cha imembe. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Na kulawa ichumba cha kuchiswili cha imembe, mbaka kuna Lilango lya Wang'olo, watsenga keli iwotengenetsa ipfinu pfa nzahabu na iwachulutsi.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kowahuma maadui iwalemile ing'onde yake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Sanibalati hayahulike ka twetwe tung'ali tuutsenga keli ubanda, kaghudubuka, kawa na usungu mkulu ng'ani, baho kanza kuwaseka Wayahudi. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Kalonga hambele ha ndughu tsake, na hambele ha lijeshi lya Samaria, “Angu Wayahudi awano nyondenyonde wotenda choni? Pfihi iwenyegho wodaha kuutsenga keli ubanda auno? Pfihi wetsagha watsolapfa nambiko na ukumalitsa ukutsenga kwa tsuwa limwe? Pfihi watsoghafukula ghamabwe aghano kulawa mna ghamalundo gha ipfifusi, ighalakale na ghumoto?” <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Naye Tobia, Munu wa Amoni tsakakala kahabehi, naye kalonga, “Pfipfila, achila chawotsenga, hata mbweha yang'adina mchanya mwake, koubomola ghendo ubanda wawo wa ghamabwe.” <verse eid="NEH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Baho nimlomba Imulungu, nilonga, “Hulika Ghwe Imulungu wetu, apfila pfatubetsighwa, na uwoyitsile ghamabetso ghawo mchanya mwa ghamatwi ghawo iwenyegho, na uwaleke waghoghighwe, na waghalighwe kuna isi ya utumwa. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Uleke kupfisa ighehile ghawo, wala inzambi yawo ileke kubaghusighwa hambele hako, kwaapfila waghalapfa ghamaligho ghawo hambele ha iwanu iwotsenga ubanda.” <verse eid="NEH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Apfo tuutsenga keli ubanda, na ubanda wose upfika nusu ya ichimo chake, kwapfila iwanu tsawana ghumoyo ghwa ukusang'ana.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Lekeni Sanibalati, na Tobia, na Waarabu, na Waamoni, na Waashidodi, hawahulike ka ing'onde ya ukuutsenga keli ubanda wa Yerusalemu yoghendelela pfinoghile, na amla mwaubomoke ubanda mwanza kudiwighwa, waghudubuka ng'ani. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Awo wose walamla hamwe watse waitowe Yerusalemu na kuwapfulugha iwanu. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Lekeni tumlomba Imulungu wetu yatukinge nawo aku twika iwanu wa ukukalitsa chilo na misi. <verse eid="NEH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Baho iwanu wa Yuda wemba wila walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">“Tsingupfu tsa iwoduta imitsigho tsihunguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">na kuna pfifusi pfingi pfa ukuduta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">lelo tudahatse ukuutsenga ubanda.?”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Na maaduwi tsetu walonga, “Ng'awatsomanya, wala ng'awatsakona baye, mbaka ahala twetwe hatutsowapfikila kwawali, na kuwakoma, na kuitenda isang'ano ayo itsighe.” <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Kuya Wayahudi iwang'ali wokala habehi nawo, watutsila na watulongela mala kumi, “Kokose kwamhundukila, watsotutsila.” <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Apfo nika wanu haisi, hachisogho ha ubanda, hanu ihakalile ng'ana hamalitsike baye ukutsengighwa, niweka iwanu wakalitse, chila wanu na lukolo lwao, akuno wakinda mapanga ghawo, na migoha yawo na minde tsawo. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Na nene ndola, nyinuka, niwalongela iwakulu, na wapfilongotsi, na iwanu wangi iwasighale, “Mleke kuwapfuka. Mkumbukeni IMNDEWA, iyali mkulu, na iyopfukighwa, mkawatowele ing'ondo ndughu tsenu, na iwanenu wamale na mapinga, na wehe wenu, na tsing'anda tsenu.” <verse eid="NEH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Na maaduwi tsetu hawahulike ka tumanya achila chawobama kututendela, na ka Imulungu kachipfulugha, wose tuya kuna ubanda, chila munu hana isang'ano yake. <verse eid="NEH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Kulawa litsuwa alyo na kughendelela, nusu ya iwanu wangu waghendelela kuutsenga ubanda, na inusu ingi wakinda imigoha, na tsingao, na tsiminde, na wapfala pfisibao pfa ukwikinga. Wapfilingotsi wapanga hachisogho ha iwanu wose wa Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Iwanu awala iwotsenga ubanda na awala iwang'ali woduta imitsigho wasang'ana ng'onde yawo akuno moko ghumwe ghuna mtsigho, na ghumoko ghungi ghukinda isilaha yake. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Na chila munu iyang'ali yotsenga tsakeyoha lipanga lyake mchighudi mwake. Na imunu iyang'ali yotowa imalati tsakakala habehi na nene. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Nani niwalongela iwakulu, na wapfillongotsi, na iwanu wose, “Isang'ano aino ng'ulu, na ighenda kutali ghendo na twetwe tupwililika ghendo, chila munu kakutali na miyaghe mna ubanda, <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />kokose kwamtsohulika imalati yolila, tsumileni kwatuli twetwe. Imulungu wetu katsotutowela ing'ondo.” <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Apfo tughendelela ukusang'ana ing'onde ayo aku inusu ya iwanu wakinda imigoha, kulawa lupfilipfili hamitondo, mbaka hamihe, hatsilawa tsinondo kulanga. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Pfipfila, ghamatsuwa ghagho niwalongela iwanu apfino, “Chila munu na mtumighwa wake wakale mghati mwa Yerusalemu, ili nechilo wawe wabetetsi wetu, na nemisi watusang'anile.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Apfo nene, na ndughu tsangu, na watumighwa wangu, na iwabetetsi iwanikoleletse, ng'atung'ali tutsula baye ghamagwanda ghetu, chila munu kakinda silaha yake mmoko mwake, hata hatughendile kudegha ghamatsi.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kowapfila iwahingwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Matsuwa chidogho hambele, wamale na mapinga wangula chililo chikulu kwa aghala ghawatendighwe na Wayahudi wayao. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Wamwenga wawo walonga, “Twetwe na iwana wetu wamale na mapinga twa wengi, ili tuwe wagima, twobama ingano ya ukuja.” <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Kuya wamwenga walonga apfino, “Twika poni imighunda yetu, na mighunda yetu ingi ya mitsabibu na tsing'anda tsetu ili tupate ingano tuleke kufa na inzala.” <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Pfipfila kuna wanu wamwenga iwalongile, “Tukopa tsisendi tulihe ikodi ya mfalume kwa kwika poni imighunda yetu na imighunda yetu ya mitsabibu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Twetwe ng'ambe twa Wayahudi ka wawo, na wana wetu ka wana wawo, lekeni twonanahitsighwa tuwalapfe wana wetu wamale na neghe tsetu wawe watumwa. Sambi neghe tsetu wamwenga wawa watumwa, na twetwe ng'atudaha baye kulighoma, kwaapfila mighunda yetu na mighunda yetu ya mitsabibu ibokighwa na wanu wangi.” <verse eid="NEH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Nani nighudubuka ghendo ahala hanihulike ichililo chao na achila chawanongele. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Hanighafikitse agho mmoyo mwangu, nilamla ukuwalonga iwakulu na ipfilongotsi apfino: “Angu mdahatse kubokela inyongetsa kulawa kwa ndughu tsenu muwenyegho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:7">Kuya nikema mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu niwalonge. <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Na niwalonga apfino, “Tutenda pfatudahile ukuwaghula ndughu tsetu Wayahudi iwautsighwe kwa iwanu wa isi tsingi. Lekeni sambi mwemwe mwowautsa ndughu tsenu wenyegho, ili twetwe tuwaghule keli.” Nawo tsawenyamala tulu, wahela cha ukulonga. <verse eid="NEH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Apfo niwalonga, “Achino chamtenda ng'achinoghile baye. Angu ng'ambamighwa baye mwemwe ukumpfuka Imulungu wetu ili tuleke kusekighwa na wanu iwotuhila wa isi tsingi? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Nene nimwenyegho na ndughu tsangu na watumwa wangu pfipfila towatsima iwanu tsisendi na ipfijo. Apfo achino chamtenda chakuwabama iwanu walihe inyongetsa chilekighwe. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Muyitse sambi baha imighunda yawo, na imighunda yawo ya mitsabibu, na mighunda yawo ya mitseituni, na tsing'anda tsawo, na hata inyongetsa ya miya imwe yamsola mna ifetsa, ipfijo, na idipfai na ghamafuta.” <verse eid="NEH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Nawo wamwidika, “Tutsowoyitsila, wala ng'atutsobama chinu chingi baye. Tutsotenda ka pfautulongele.” Baho niwakema iwatambika, niwalongela iwakulu na pfilongotsi welahe hambele ha iwatambika awo ka watsotenda achila chatwilaghane. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Kuya nikung'usa libeme lya ligwanda lyanyohile mchuno mwangu, nilonga, “Imulungu naye yamkung'use pfipfino chila munu na ing'anda yake na ing'onde yake, iyoleka kutenda achino chatwilaghane. Apfo yakung'usighwe na yakale kahela chinu ghendo.” Na ghumtingano ghwose ghwa iwanu ghwidika, “Amina” Wamtunya Imulungu. Iwanu watenda ka apfila pfatwilaghane.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uluso wa Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kulawa hanisaghulighwe niwe mkulu mna isi ya Yuda kwa miyaka kumi na mili, kulawa ghumwaka ghwa ishilini mbaka ghumwaka ghwa salasini na mili ghwa mfalume Aritashasta, nene wala ndughu tsangu ng'atujile baye ichijo ichibamighwa kujighwa na imtawala. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Lekeni wakulu wa iwanongolele nene tsawawa mtsigho kwa iwanu, wang'ali wowabama waweng'e ipfijo na idipfai, pfipfila na wang'ali wosola sendi pfihande alubaini pfa fetsa. Hata iwatumwa wawo nawo tsawawabunza iwanu. Lekeni nene sitendile apfo baye, kwaapfila ning'ali nimpfuka Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Tsandapfa ghendo ngupfu tsangu tsose mna ing'onde aino ya ukuutsenga keli ubanda, na ng'atusolile mghunda baye, na watumwa wangu tsawetingana wenyegho kung'onde. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Kubita agho, nene ning'ali nikuja na Wayahudi na pfilongotsi miya na hamsini, hamwe na iwanu iwotutsila kulawa isi tsili habehi na twetwe. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Chila tsuwa yang'ali yochinjighwa ng'ombe yumwe na ng'olo sita wanoghile na wang'uku. Na haghobita matsuwa kumi ning'ali nilapfa dipfai nyingi, lekeni nene siwabamile baye iwanu walihe ichijo ichibamighwa yeng'ighwe mtawala, kwaapfila tsanimanya iwanu wang'ali wonanahitsighwa kulapfa ipfinu. <verse eid="NEH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Ung'umbuke, Ghwe Imulungu wang, kwa uluso waniwatendele iwanu awano.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Litsengwe lya ukumkoma Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Lelo Sanibalati, na Tobia, na Geshemu, imunu wa Arabu, na iwanu wamwenga iwotuhila hawahulike ka nimalitsa kuutsenga keli ubanda na wala haduhu hanu halekighwe, na matsuwa agho tsasina nyike milango baye mna ghamalango ghake gha ukwingilila, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu wawatuma wanu kuna nene, walonga, “Tuhulumke tuketingane hana tsikaye tsili mchiwala cha Ono.” Kumbe wawo wang'ali wobama wakandaghe. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Na nene niwatuma wanu kuna wawo niwalongela, “Ing'onde yanisang'ana nene ng'ulu sideke nene sihulumka baye ako, Angu pfihi nitse ako niileke ing'onde ime?” <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Nawo wanitumila wanu mala nne kunongele imbuli yiyino, na nene niwedika chichila. <verse eid="NEH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Baho Sanibalati kamtuma munu wake kuna nene mala ya tano akuno kakinda ibaluwa ili mwatsi mmoko, <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />nayo yandikighwa apfino, “Kuna mbuli tsenela mna tsiisi tsili habehi, na Geshemu kolonga mbuli atso tsolongesa ghendo, ka ghweghwe na Wayahudi mwobama kumbiduka mfalume, ichinu achino chicho ichiwatenda mwemwe mtsenge ubanda, na kwa imbuli ayo yatuhulike ghweghwe kobama kuwa mfalume wawo, <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />pfipfila ghweghwe kuwasaghula manabii Yerusalemu watangatseghe kulonga: ‘Mna isi ya Yuda kuna mfalume!’ Lelo mfalume Aritashasta katsolongelighwa tsimbuli atsino. Apfo utse twitingane tulamle cha ukutenda.” <verse eid="NEH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Na nene nimtumila wanu, nonga, “Agho ghaulonga ng'ana ghatendeke baye, agho koghalonga ghwegwe ghumwenyegho kalawa mwitwi mwako.” <verse eid="NEH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Wose tsawabama ghendo kututenda tupfuke, akuno wolonga, “Ghamoko ghawo ghatsoleghela ukusang'ana, na ing'onde ng'aitsomala baye.” Baho nilomba nonga, “Ghwe Imulungu wangu nyongetse ingupfu.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Tsuwa limwe ng'enda ukaye kwa Shemaya, mwana wa Delaya mwana wa Mehetabeli, iyohighwe mng'anda mwake, kanongela apfino: “Twitingane mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, na imilango yake tuhinde twipfise, kwaapfila wakutsa kukukoma, ona, leloli nechilo wakutsa kukukoma ghendo.” <verse eid="NEH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Lekeni nonga, “Angu munu ka nene nitsume? Angu munu ka nene nodaha kutsumila kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu nikaukombole ugima wangu? Mbe, sighenda baye!” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Apfo nitanga ka Imulungu ng'amtumile baye, lekeni kanitabilia pfihile kwaapfila Tobia na Sanibalati tsawamhonga. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Tsawamliha yanitende nene nipfuke, na nitende nzambi, apfo wang'alihinyile litaghwa lyangu na kunighela chinyala. <verse eid="NEH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Nilomba, “Ghwe Imulungu, ukumbuke ghose aghala ghawatendile Tobia na Sanibalati, pfipfila umkumbuke Noadia nabii pinga na manabii wose iwabamile kunitenda nene nipfuke.”<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa ing'onde ya ukuutsenga Ubanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Apfo ubanda umala ukutsengighwa mna litsuwa lya ishilini na tano lya mwetsi ighukemighwa Eluli. Ubanda utsengighwa kwa matsuwa hamsini na mbili. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Maaduwi wose iwotuhila iwali mna isi tsose itsitutsunguluka hawahulike tsawapfuka ghendo, na wona chinyala ghendo, kwaapfila tsawamanya ghendo ka ing'onde aino tsaimalitsika kwa kwapfilighwa na Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="NEH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Pfipfila mna ghamatsuwa agho pfilongotsi wa Yuda wang'ali womtumila Tobia baluwa, naye Tobia tsakaghendelela ukuwedika kwa baluwa. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Wanu wengi iwali Yuda tsawelaha kumtegheletsa Tobia, kwaapfila tsakamkwela neghe Shekania mwana wa Ara, na imwanaghe Yehonani tsakamkwela neghe Meshulamu, mwana wa Berekia. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Pfipfila wanongela ighanoghile ghayatendile Tobia, nawo wang'ali womlongela chila chinu chanongile. Na Tobia yang'ali yotuma tsibaluwa kunenda nene nipfuke.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Lelo ubanda haumalile ukutsengighwa, na imilango yake kwikighwa hanu hake, na iwanu iwokalitsa imilango, iwanu iwakwimba na Walawi hawasaghulighwe na kwing'ighwa ng'onde tsawo, <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />nimsaghula ndughu yangu Hanani, hamwe na Hanania mkulu wa ingome wawe wakulu wa Yerusalemu, kwaapfila Hanania tsa munu iyotogholighwa na yang'ali yompfuka Imulungu kubita wose. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Niwalongela, “Ghamalango gha Yerusalemu ghaleke kupfughulighwa mbaka nemitondo litsuwa halitsolawa, mhinde ghamalango agho na mwike ghamakomeo ghake aku iwokalitsa ghamalango wang'ali baho. Pfipfila muwasaghule iwanu iwokala Yerusalemu nawo wakalitse, chila yumwe yakale hanu hayokalitsa, na wamwenga wakale habehi kwilolesa na tsing'anda tsawo.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwoyile kulawa mna isi tsa Utumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu tsaghukala mkulu na mghatsi, lekeni iwanu iwakalile amwo tsa wachidogho, tsing'anda natso tsang'ana tsitsengighwe baye.<verse eid="NEH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Imulungu wangu kanilongotsa mmoyo mwangu niwakeme hamwe iwakulu, pfilongotsi na iwanu ili wapetighwe kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo tsawolawa. Na mbona ichitabu cha tsikolo tsa iwanu iwalongole ukuya, na achino chicho chandikighwe amwo.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Awano wawo iwanu iwoyile kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu na isi ya Yuda kulawa akula kwawahamile, iwaghoghighwe na kughalighwa na Nebukadneza mfalume wa Babeli, chila munu koya ukaye yake. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Tsawoya na pfilongotsi wawo awano, Zerubabeli, Yoshua, Nehemia, Seraya, Reelaya, Nahamani, Moridekai, Bilishani, Misipari, Bigwai, Rehumu, na Baana. Na tsikolo tsa Isiraeli itsuyile kulawa Babeli atsino ahano. <verse eid="NEH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Iwanu wa lukolo lwa Paroshi iwoyile tsa wanu elufu mbili na miya imwe na sabini na weli, <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />na iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Shafatia, tsa miya ndatu na sabini na weli, <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Na wanu wa ilukolo lwa Ara, tsa miya sita hamsini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Na wanu wa ilukolo lwa Pahati Moabu, awala iwatsukulu wa Yeshua na Yoabu, tsa elufu mbili na miya nane kumi na wanane. <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Na wanu wa Elamu iwoyile tsa elufu imwe na miya mbili na hamsini na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Zatu tsa miya nane na alubaini na tano, <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Zakai miya saba na sitini. <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Wanu wa ilukolo lwa Binui: miya sita alubaini na wanane, <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />iwanu wa ilukolo wa Bebai tsa miya sita ishilini na wanane; <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Azigadi tsa elufu mbili miya ndatu ishilini na weli, <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Adonikamu tsa miya sita sitini na saba, <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Bigwai tsa elufu mbili na sitini na saba, <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Adini iwoyile tsa miya sita hamsini na watano, <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Ateri pfipfila yakemighwa Hezekia tsa tisini na wanane, <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Hashumu tsa miya ndatu na ishirini na wanane, <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Bezai tsa miya ndatu ishirini na wane, <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />wanu wa ilukolo lwa Halifu tsa miya imwe kumi na weli, <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Gibeoni tsa tisini na watano. <verse eid="NEH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Pfipfila wanu wa Betilehemu na Netofu iwoyile tsa miya imwe semanini na wanane. <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Iwanu wa Anatoti tsa miya imwe na ishirini na wanane. <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Iwanu wa Beti Azimaweti tsa alubaini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Iwanu wa Kiriati Yearimu, na Kefira, na Beeroti iwoyile tsa miya saba alubaini na wadatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Iwanu wa Rama na Geba tsa miya sita na ishirini na yumwe. <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Iwanu wa Mikimashi tsa miya imwe na ishirini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Iwanu wa Beteli na Ai tsa miya imwe ishirini na wadatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghungi ghwa Nebo tsa hamsini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghungi ghwa Elamu tsa elufu imwe na miya mbili hamsini na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Na iwanu wa Harimu tsa miya ndatu na ishirini. <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Iwanu wa lukoo lwa Yeriko tsa miya ndatu alubaini na watano. <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Iwanu wa lukoo lwa Lodi na Hadidi, na Ono tsa miya saba ishilini na yumwe. <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Iwanu wa ilukoo lwa Senaa tsa elufu ndatu miya tisa na selasini. <verse eid="NEH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Iwatambika iwoyile wawo awano, watambika wa lukolo lwa Yedaya, watambika wa ikaya ya Yeshua tsa miya tisa sabini na wadatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Iwatambika wa ilukolo lwa Imeri tsa elufu imwe na hamsini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Iwatambika wa ilukoo lwa Pashuri tsa elufu imwe, miya mbili na alubaini na saba. <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Iwatambika wa lukolo lwa Harimu tsa elufu imwe na kumi na saba. <verse eid="NEH 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Iwalawi iwoyile kulawa Babeli tsa awano: Walawi wa lukolo lwa Yeshua, kubitila kwa iwanaghe Kadimieli, na Hodavia tsa sabini na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Na iwanu iwang'ali wakwimba, wa lukolo lwa Asafu tsa miya imwe na alubaini na wanane. <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Na iwokalitsa imilango tsa iwana wa Shalumu na wa Ateli na wa Talimoni na wa Kubu na wa Hatia na wana Shobai tsa miya imwe na salasini na wanane. <verse eid="NEH 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Kolo tsisang'ane mna ing'anda ya Imulungu tsuyile tsitso atsino: ilukolo lwa Ziha, lwa Hasufa, lwa Tabaoti, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />lwa Kerosi, lwa Siaha, lwa Padoni, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />lwa Lebana, lwa Hagaba, lwa Shalimai, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />lwa Hanani, lwa Gideli, lwa Gahari, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />lwa Reaya, lwa Resini, lwa Nekoda, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />lwa Gazamu, lwa Uza, lwa Pasea, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />lwa Besai, lwa Meunimu, na lwa Nefushesimu. <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Pfipfila lukolo lwa Bakibuki, lwa Hakufa, lwa Harihuri, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />lwa Basiliti, lwa Mehida, lwa Harisha, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />lwa Barikosi, lwa Sisera, lwa Tema, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />lwa Nezia na ilukolo lwa Hatifa. <verse eid="NEH 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Kolo tsa watumwa wa Selemani tsuyile kulawa mna isi tsa utumwa atsino ahano: Lukolo lwa Sotai, lwa Sofereti, lwa Perida, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />lwa Yaala, lwa Darikoni, na lwa Gideli, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />na lukolo lwa Shefatia, lwa Hatili, lwa Pokereti Hasebaimu, na lukolo lwa Amoni. <verse eid="NEH 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Iwatumwa wose iwasang'ane mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, na kolo tsa watumwa wa Selemani tsa miya ndatu na tisini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Wanu wa imiji aino nawo tsawoya, iwanu wa ghu mji ghwa Teli Mela, ghwa Teli Harisha, ghwa Kerubu, ghwa Adoni na wa ghumji ghwa Imeri, lekeni ng'awadahile baye ukwonesa ka nawawo wolawa mna tsikolo tsa Isiraeli. <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Iwanu awo wolawa mna ilukolo lwa Delaya, lwa Tobia na lwa Nekoda, wose tsa wanu miya sita na alubaini na weli.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Na iwatambika iwoyile tsa awano, iwana wa Hobaya, wa Hakosi na wa Barizilai iyakwelile neghe wa Barizilai iyolawa Gileadi, apfo kakemighwa kwa litaghwa lilyo. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Nawo wabama ghamataghwa ghawo mna tsikumbukumbu tsa tsikolo lekeni ng'awaghonile baye, apfo woneka weha, na ng'awatangike baye ka watambika. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Apfo imkulu wa isi kawalongela waleke kuja ichijo ichilapfighwa kwa Imulungu, mbaka yapfike imtambika iyolamla kwa ghamabwe gha Urimu na Thumimu yalamle. <verse eid="NEH 7:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Iwanu wose iwoyile kulawa isi ya utumwa tsa wanu elfu alubani na mbili, miya ndatu na sitini. <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Watumwa wamale na mapinga tsawapetighwa elufu saba na miya ndatu na salasini na saba, Na iwang'ali wakwimba wamale na mapinga tsa miya mbili na alubaini na tano. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Woya na falasi miya saba na salasini na sita, na pundafalasi miya mbili na alubaini na tano, <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Na ngamiya miya nne salasini na watano, na pfihongwe elufu sita miya saba na ishilini.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Na wakulu wamwenga wa tsikolo walapfa pfinu pfao pfisang'ane mna ing'onde aino. Imkulu wa isi yose kalapfa kilo nane tsa nzahabu, mabeseni hamsini, na maghwanda miya tano na salasini gha iwatambika. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Wakulu wamwenga wa tsikolo walapfa kilo miya imwe na sitini na nane tsa nzahabu na kilo elufu imwe na miya mbili na hamsini tsa fetsa. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Na iwanu iwakalile walapfa kilo miya imwe sitini na nane tsa nzahabu na maghwanda sitini na saba gha watambika. <verse eid="NEH 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Manabii, Walawi na iwokalitsa ing'anda ya Imulungu, na awala iwang'ali wakwimba, na wanu wamwenga na watumwa wa ing'anda ya Imulungu na wanu wose wa Isiraeli wakala mmakaye mwao.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ezira Kowasomela Ghamalaghitso Iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Haghupfikile ghumwetsi ghwa saba iwanu wose tsawakala mna imiji yawo. mna tsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi agho iwanu wose wetingana hamwe hana ichibwalu ichili habehi na Lilango lya Ghamatsi wawa chinu chimwe, wamlongela Ezra iyaghamanyile ghamalaghitso yalete ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso gha Musa, IMNDEWA chayawalaghitse Waisraeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Naye mtambika Ezra kachighala ichitabu acho hana ghumtingano ghwa iwanu, ighumemile iwamale na mapinga na wanu wose iwodaha kumanya. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Kawasomela ichitabu acho kwa litsi kulu hambele ha ichibwalu iching'ali chilolesa na Lilango lya Ghamatsi kulawa nemitondo mbaka nemisi, aku wamale na mapinga na wose iwamanyile nawo tsawabaho, na iwanu wawamba ghamaghutwi kutegheletsa ighali mna ichitabu cha Ghamalaghitso.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ezra, imunu yomanya malaghitso, kema hana lijukwaa ilitsengighwe na tsimbao kwa isang'ano ayo ya ukusomela. Na habehi hake, kuna ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo wema Matitia, Shema, Anaya, Uria, Hilikia na Maasea, na kuna ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso wema wima Pedaya, Mishaeli, Malikiya, Hashumu, Hashibadana, Zekaria na Meshulamu. <verse eid="NEH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ezra kachipfughula ichitabu akuno iwanu wose wolola, kwaapfila yeye tsakema hanu henuke, na hayachipfughule iwanu wose tsawema. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Naye Ezra kamtunya MNDEWA, Imulungu iyali mkulu na iwanu wose wenula ghamoko ghawo na wedika, “Amina! Amina!” Kuya wamwinamila IMNDEWA mbaka pfihanga pfawo pfidonza hasi <verse eid="NEH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Kuya iwanu wenuka wema wima. Baho Walawi awano, Yeshua, Bani, Sherebia, Yamini, Akubu, Shabetai, na Hodai, na Maaseya, na Kelita, na Azaria, na Yozabadi, na Hanani, na Pelaya, wawapfila iwanu kughamanya ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Wawasomela pfinoghile kulawa mna ichitabu cha Imulungu na wawalongela iwanu achila chawawasomele chilongatse. <verse eid="NEH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Iwanu wose wang'ali wolila hawahulike ghamalaghitso gha Musa, naye Nehemia iyakalile mkulu wa isi, na Ezra mtambika na Walawi, iwawafundile iwanu, tsawawalongela iwanu wose apfino, “Alino tsuwa lienzeluke kwa IMNDEWA, iyali Imulungu wenu, apfo mleke kudomboketsa wala kulila.” <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Kuya kawalongela, “Mke na mkaje achila ichinonile na mnwe chilimta na mumgholele ayula iyalihela chinu, kwaapfila leloli tsuwa lienzeluke kwa IMNDEWA, na mleke kuwa na usungu, kwaapfila ukudeng'elela kwayoweng'ani IMNDEWA, koweng'ani mwemwe ingupfu.” <verse eid="NEH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Apfo Walawi wang'ali wobita wowalongela iwanu wenyamale, wawalongela, “Nyamaleni, kwaapfila leloli tsuwa lienzeluke, mleke kusing'inika.” <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Baho iwanu wose woka, waghenda kuja na kunwa na kuwagholela wayao achila chawali nacho na kudeng'elela kwa ukutenda chihungo chikulu, kwaapfila tsawamanya aghala ghose ghawalongelighwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichihungo cha ipfibumbulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Ilupfi yake, wakulu wose wa tsikolo na watambika na Walawi wetingana kwa Ezra, iyaghamanyile ghamalaghitso, ili yawafunde ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Na wona lilaghitso alila IMNDEWA lyayamlaghitse Musa lyandikighwa ka iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wobamighwa wakale mna ipfibumbulika mna ichihungo cha ghumwetsi ghwa saba. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Apfo wawalongela iwanu lilaghitso na walyenetsa muisi mwose na Yerusalemu, wawalongela, “Ghendani kupfidunda na muye na ghamaputila gha minzeituni, minzeituni ya kubagho, mihadasi, mitende na mibiki ya chimbeho ya ukutsengela pfibumbulika ka pfayandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Apfo iwanu waghenda kusola maputila wetsengele pfibumbulika, chila munu mna ichiswilii chake, na hana ichibwalu cha ing'anda yake na ichibwalu cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, na hana ichibwalu cha Lilango lya Ghamatsi, na ichibwalu cha Lilango lya Efuraimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Iwanu wose woyile kulawa mna isi ya utumwa watsenga ipfibumbulika pfawo na wakala mumo, kwaapfila kulawa matsuwa gha Yoshua mwana wa Nuni mbaka litsuwa alyo Waisiraeli tsang'ana wadeng'elele ka apfo baye, apfo wadeng'elela sideke. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Kulawa litsuwa lya mwanduso mbaka lya utsighilo, Ezra kawasomela iwanu ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso, na watenda chihungo kwa matsuwa saba, mna litsuwa lya nane tsakuna mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu, ka pfawalaghitsighwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli Woungama Tsinzambi Tsawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Na mna litsuwa lya ishilini na nne lya ghumwetsi aghwo ghwa saba, wanu wa Isiraeli wetingana hamwe, wafunga ukuja, akuno wapfala maghunila na webakatsa litimbwisi mwitwi mwao. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Waisiraeli awo webaghula na iwanu wa isi tsingi, wema na ukuungama tsinzambi tsawo, na ka wahenga wawo nawo tsawatenda gheghile. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Wema aku wosoma kwa matsuwa madatu mna ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA Imulungu wawo, na masaa ghangi madatu hambele wang'ali woungama tsnzambi, na wamtamanila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Kuya Walawi awano, Yeshua, Bani, Kadmieli, Shebania, Buni, Sherebia, Bani na Kenani wema mna tsingatsi na kumlomba IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo kwa litsi kulu. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Na Walawi awano: Yeshua, Kadimieli, Bani, Hashabunea, Sherebia, Hodia, Shebania, Petahia wawalongela iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Mwime na mumtunye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">mtunyeni yeye matsuwa ghose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Na iwanu walitunye litaghwa lyake kulu, ilinulighwe kubita tsibalaka tsose na ukwirunya kose.”<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra Kolomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ezira kalonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">“Ghweghwe uliyeka yuyo IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">Ghweghwe yuumbile kulanga na pfinu pfake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">yuumbile isi na pfose pfili mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">ibahali na pfinu pfose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">Na ghweghwe yuyo yupfing'ile ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">na ipfinu pfose pfili kulanga pfokwinamila.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Ghweghwe kwa IMNDEWA Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">Yumsaghule Abramu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">Yumlapfile kulawa Uri ya Wakaldayo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">na yumwing'ile taghwa lingi Abrahamu.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Ghweghwe kumwona kotogholighwa hambele hako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">Naghwe kwilaghana naye kuweng'a watsukulu wake isi ya Wakanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">ya Wahiti, na ya Waamori, na ya Waperizi, na Wayebusi, na ya Wagirigashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">Na malaghano ghako kughatenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">kwaapfila ghweghwe kotogholighwa.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />Kughona maghayo gha iwahenga wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">hawang'ali wa Misiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">naghwe kuhulika ichililo chao kuna ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Kumtendela pfihulo na pfinu pfa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">ukukangawatsa mfalume Farao, na watumwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">wake wose na wanu wake wose wa isi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">kwaapfila tsakumanya pfawawatendele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">kwa ichidandali sekulu tsetu, na kwitenda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">ghumwenyegho umanyike mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Na kuighola ibahali hambele hawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">nawo wabita hanu hanyalile haghati ha ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">na awala iwawawinzile kuwadidimitsa mna ghamatsi ighaghendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">ka libwe pfalitsama mna ghamatsi mengi.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Nemisi ghweghwe kuwalongotsa kwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">ngutso ya libingu, na nechilo kuwalongotsa kwa ngutso</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">ya ghumoto, kuwamwemwesela inzila yawobita.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Pfipfila kuhulumka akula kuchidunda Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">na kulonga nawo kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">kuweng'a imiko inoghile, ghamalumutsi ighanoghile na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">malaghitso igholongesa, na tsiamli tsinoghile.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Na kuitenda Sabato yako ienzeluke imanyike kuna wawo na waikinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">na kuweng'a ghamalaghitso na malamtsi na imiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">kubitila imtumwa wako Musa.<verse eid="NEH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Hawakalile na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">kuweng'a ichijo ichikemighwe mana kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">na hawakalile na ng'ilu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">kuweng'a ghamatsi kulawa mna libambalawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Na kuwalongela waghende kuisola isi yawilaghane nawo ukuweng'a.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Lekeni wawo wahenga tsetu wakala na chidandali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">na wawa wasughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">ng'awakindile baye ghamalaghitso ghako,<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Walemesa ukuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">wesemwa ghendo ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa pfauwatendele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Lekeni wawo wawa wasughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">kwa chidandali chao wamsaghula chilongotsi wawo woye kuna isi ya utumwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Lekeni ghweghwe kwa Imulungu yuleghusa tsinzambi tsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">kumema uluso na libatsi, ng'usumka baye kughudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">kuna wende wingi, naghwe ng'uwalekile baye.<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Na ahala hawetengenetsele chinyagho cha mwana wa ing'ombe na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">‘Ayuno yuyo Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">iyatulapfile mna isi ya Misiri,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">ng'ambe tsawakuligha ghweghwe.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna libatsi sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">ng'uwalekile waliyeka baye kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">Ingutso ya libingu ing'ali iwalongotsa nemisi ng'aiwalekile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">wala ingutso ya ghumoto ing'ali iwamwemwesela nechilo ng'aiwalekile baye mna inzila yawang'ali woluta.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Kuweng'a iloho yako inoghile iwalongele cha ukutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">na ichijo cha mana ng'uwemile baye, na kuweng'a ghamatsi wahotse ing'ilu yawo.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Kwa miyaka alubaini ghweghwe kuwatunza mna lijangwa, kuweng'a chila chinu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">Ghamagwanda ghawo ng'aghalalile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">wala ghamaghulu ghawo ng'aghapfimbile baye.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Pfipfila kuweng'a tsifalume na tsiisi tsa wanu wangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">na kuwagholela mbaka tsiisi tsili kutali ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">waibola isi ya Heshiboni ya mfalume Sihoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">na isi ya Bashani ya mfalume Ogi.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Na kuwongetsa iwatsukulu wawo wawa wengi ka nondo tsili kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">na kuwalongotsa mna isi yuwalongele wahenga wawo waghende na kuiboka iwe yawo.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Apfo iwana wawo waghenda na waiboka isi ya Kanani nayo iwa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">na wawatowa Wakanani iwakalile muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">kuweka mna ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">wafalume wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">na iwanu wa isi tsawo, wawatende ka pfawobama.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Waboka imiji ina ubanda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na isi tsina lidongo linoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na tsing'anda tsimemile chila chinu chinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na pfisima ipfihimbighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na mighunda ya minzabibu na minzeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na mibiki ina ghamatunda mengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">Apfo waja na weghuta na waneneha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na wadeng'elela uluso wako.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Lekeni ng'awakuhulikitse baye na wakulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">walema kukinda ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">na wawakoma manabii wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">iwawakanyile wakuyile ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">na wakuligha ghweghwe maligho makulu.<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Apfo kuwaleka waghoghighwe na maaduwi tsawo iwawadununze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Na hawang'ali wodununzika, wakulilila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">naghwe kuhulika ichililo chawo kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">na kuwonela libatsi sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">kuweng'a iwanu iwawakombole kulawa mna ghamoko gha maaduwi tsawo.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Lekeni hawakalile tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">watenda keli ghehile hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">naghwe kuwaleka waghoghighwe na maduwi tsawo ili wawatawale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Nawo hawakulilile keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">ghweghwe kuwahulika kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">na kwa libatsi lyako kuwakombola chila mala.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Kuwakanya ili waghoyile ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">lekeni kwa chidandali chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">waleka kukinda tsiamli tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">atsila imunu yang'atsikinda katsokala pfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">wakala na chidandali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">wawa wasughu na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">walema ukukuhulikitsa.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Kwa miyaka mingi kuwadudumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">na kuwakanya kwa Iloho wako kubitila manabii wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">lekeni ng'awakuhulikitse baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">apfo kuwaleka waghoghighwe na wanu wa isi tsingi tsa habehi.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Lekeni kwa libatsi lyako ng'uwalekile baye wahupe wala wakomighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">kwaapfila ghwehwe kwa Imulungu wa libatsi na uluso.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />Apfo lelo, Ghweghwe Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">Yauli mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">Imulungu yana ingupfu na iyopfukighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">ghweghwe yuikindagha laghano lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">ghamaghayo ghatupatile twetwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">na wafalume wetu, na iwakulu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">na watambika wetu, na manabii wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">na wahenga wetu, na iwanu wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kulawa matsuwa gha wafalume wa Ashuru mbaka leloli aino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">uleke kughona madodo.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Lekeni mna ghose agho ighatupatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">ghweghwe tsakulamla ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">kutenda apfila pfaibamighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">hata ka twetwe tung'ali tutenda ghehile.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Wafalume wetu, na iwakulu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">na watambika wetu na wahenga wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">ng'awahulikitse baye tsiamli tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">ng'awakindile baye ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">wala imiko yako yauweng'ile.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Hata ka tsawapata ufalume wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">na wodeng'elela ighanoghile ghako ghauweng'ile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">mna isi ng'ulu na inoghile yauweng'ile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">lekeni tsawalema ukukusang'anila na ukuleka ghehile.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Lelo lola, leloli twawatumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">twawatumwa ghendo mna isi aino yuweng'ile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">wahenga wetu waje ghamatunda ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">na pfinu pfingi ipfinoghile ipfimela mumo.<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Kwa tsinzambi tsatutendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">ipfinu ipfimela muno pfowaghendela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">wafalume yuwaghalile watutawale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">pfipfila wotawala ng'uli tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">na wanyama wetu ka pfawobama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Twamna maghayo makulu.”<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu Wakwika Laghano</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Kwa aghala ghose ighatulawile twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:38">twakwika laghano kwa kwandika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:38">na twakwandika ghamataghwa gha iwakulu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:38">na Walawi wetu, na iwatambika wetu wakwika imihuli.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Apfo awano ahano wawo iwekile ghumuhuli: Nehemia yuyo imkulu wa isi, mwana wa Hakalia, na Sedekia, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Iwatambika iwekile ghumhuli wawo wano, Seraya, Azaria, Yeremia, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pashuri, Amaria, Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hatushi, Shebania, Maluki, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harimu, Meremoti, Obadia, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Danieli, Ginetoni, Baruki, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meshulamu, Abiya, Miyamini, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maazia, Biligai na Shemaya. <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Pfipfila Walawi nawo tsawabaho. Nawo wawo awano: Yeshua, mwana wa Azania, Binui, yumwe wa iwana wamale wa Henadadi, na Kadimieli. <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Na ndugu tsawo iwekile ghumuhuli wawo awano: Shebania, Hodia, Kelita, Pelaya, Hanani, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rehobu, Hashabia, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakuri, Sherebia, Shebania, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodia, Bani na Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Awao wawo pfilongotsi wawo: Paroshi, Pahath moabu, Elamu, Zatu, Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni, Azigadi, Bebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya, Bigwai, Adini, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ateri, Hezekia, Azuri, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodia, Hashumu, Bezai, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harifu, Anatoti, Nebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magipiashi, Meshulamu, Heziri, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabeli, Sadoki, Yadua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatia, Hanani, Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoshea, Hanania, Hashubu, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheshi, Piliha, Shobeki, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehumu, Hashabina, Maaseya, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahia, Hanani, Anani, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluki, Harimu, na Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli Welaghana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Hamwe na iwasighale, watambika na Walawi na iwokalitsa ghamalango na awala iwakwimba na iwosang'ana mna ing'anda ya Imulungu na wanu wose iwebaghule na iwanu wa tsiisi tsahabehi, wawinze malaghitso gha Imulungu hamwe na wehe tsawo, wana wawo wose wamale na mapinga iwomanya na kutanga, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />Wose ghendo tuwa chinu chimwe hamwe na ndughu tsetu, na wakulu wetu mna ukwilaha ka tutsokala kwa kuwinza ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu, ghayamwing'ile Musa, imtumighwa wake. Na tutsoghakinda ghamalaghitso ghose, na malamutsi na imiko yose ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Na ng'atutsowalapfa baye neghe tsetu wakwelighwe na iwanu wa isi tsingi, wala wanetu wamale wawakwele wana wawo. <verse eid="NEH 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Na wanu wa isi tsingi tsa habehi wang'aghala pfinu pfawo wautse au pfijo pfawo mna litsuwa lya sabato, twetwe ng'atutsoghula baye mna litsuwa lya Sabato wala tsuwa lingi lienzeluke. Chila mna ghumwaka ghwa saba ng'atuilima baye mighunda yetu na tutsoleka kuwadai iwanu ghamadeni. <verse eid="NEH 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />Twetwe twikila tuwenyegho lilaghitso lya ukulapfa glamu nne tsa fetsa chila mwaka iwe ya kughulila ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Itsoghula pfighate pfienzeluke, na nambiko tsa ipfijo na nambiko tsa wanyama wa ukulakatsighwa, na kughulila nambiko ya Sabato, nambiko tsa chihungo cha ukulawa kwa ghumwetsi, na itsoghula nambiko tsa pfihungo pfingi pfawatulaghitse, na nambiko tsa ukuleghusa tsinzambi, tsa kuwalamlitsa Waisiraeli na Imulungu wao, na itsoghula chila chinu ichibamighwa mna ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="NEH 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Twetwe wose, watambika na Walawi tutsakwasa simbi chila mwaka tulamle ka lukolo lwachi lutsoghala tsingodi tsa ukulakatsila tsinambiko hana imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu ka apfila pfayandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Na chila mwaka tutsoghala kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ipfijo pfatukwanza ukupfuna na litunda ilikwanza ukwipfa lya chila mbiki. <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Ka apfila pfayandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso, tutsoghala kwa iwatambika iwosang'ana amwo chila mwana mmale chaudele iyoneka mna tsing'anda tsetu, ili wekighwe hambele ha Imulungu, pfipfila tutsoghala chila mwana iyolongola koneka wa ing'ombe, wa imene, na wa ing'olo. <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Pfipfila tutsoghala kwa iwatambika, utimbo wa ipfijo pfatukwanza kupfuna pfa imighunda yetu, nambiko tsetu tsa ipfijo, ghamatunda gha imibiki yetu yose, dipfai yetu ya sambi, na ghamapfuta gha mitseituni. Na tutsoghala itsaka yetu kwa Walawi iwobokela itsaka kulawa kuna tsikaye tsatukala. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Imtambika iyolawa mna lweleko lwa Aruni kobamighwa yakale baho hamwe na Walawi ahala Walawi hawobokela itsaka, na Walawi awo wobamighwa walapfe lifungu lya kumi lya itsaka ayo kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu, wakaike mna tsikano tsili mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Wanu wa Isiraeli na Walawi watsoghala tsinambiko tsa ipfijo, idipfai ghamapfuta gha nzeituni kuna ipfiheleto ipfikala ipfinu pfenzeluke, na pfawokala iwatambika, na iwokalitsa ghamalango na iwanu iwakwimba. Ng'atutsoisemwa baye ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu Iwakalile Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Lelo pfilongotsi wa iwanu wakala Yerusalemu na iwanu wose wasa simbi wasaghule kaya imwe kulawa mna chila kaya kumi itse ikale Yerusalemu ghumji ghwenzeluke, na atsila tsingi tisa tsikale mna imiji yawo. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Na iwanu wawatunya awala wose iwabamile wenyegho kukala Yerusamu. <verse eid="NEH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Hata apfo kuna pfilongotsi wa iwanu iwatsile kukala Yerusalemu, na imiji ya Yuda, Waisiraeli, iwatambika na Walawi, iwokalitsa ghamalango, na iwatumighwa wa Selemani tsawakala mna tsikaya tsawo wenyegho, mna imiji yawo. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Wanu wamwenga wa likabila lya Yuda, na wa likabila lya Benjamini tsawakala kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda iwakalile kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu awano hano. Ataya, yelekighwe na Uzia, Uzia naye yelekighwe na Zekaria, Zekaria yelekighwe na Amaria, Amaria naye yelekighwe na Shefatia, naye Shefatia yelekighwe na Mahalaleli, wose awo walawa mna lukolo lwa Peresi. <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Pfipfila Maaseya yelekighwe na Baruku, Baruku yelekighwe na Kolihoze, Kolihoze yelekighwe na Hazaya, Hazaya yelekighwe na Adaya, Adaya yelekighwe na Yoyaribu, naye Yoyaribu yelekighwe na Zekaria, iyolawa mna lweleko lwa Shilo. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Iwanu wa lukolo lwa Peresi iwakalile Yerusalemu tsa wanu miya nne na sitini na nane iwana ngupfu. <verse eid="NEH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Benjamini iwakalile Yerusalemu awano ahano: Salu kelekighwa na Meshulamu, Meshulamu kelekighwa na Yoedi, Yoedi kelekighwa na Pedaya, Pedaya kelekighwa na Kolaya, naye Kolaya kelekighwa na Maaseya, Maaseya kelekighwa na Itieli iyolawa mna lweleko lwa Yeshaya. <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Pfipfila ndughu tsake Gabai na Salai tsawapfika miya tisa na ishilini na wanane. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoeli, mwana wa Zikiri, tsa chilongotsi wawo, na Yuda mwana Hasenua tsa chilongotsi wawo wa keli.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Na iwatambika Yedaya, Yoyaribu, Yakini, na <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Seraya, mwana wa Hilikia, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Sadoki, mwana wa Merayothi, mwana wa Ahitubu, mkulu wa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />Wose wose tsawapfika miya nane ishilini na weli, na hamwe na ndughu tsawo iwasang'ane ing'onde mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, na Adaya, mwana wa Yerohamu, mwana wa Pelalia, mwana wa Amzi, mwana wa Zekaria, mwana wa Pashuri, mwana wa Malikiya. <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />Na ndughu tsake iwawile pfilongotsi wa tsikolo tsa aba tsawo, wose tsa miya mbili na alubaini na weli. Pfipfila tsakuna Amashisai kelekighwa na Azareli, Azareli kelekighwa na Azai, Azai kelekighwa na Meshilemoti, naye Meshilemoti kelekighwa na Imeri <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />hamwe na ndughu tsake, wamale iwadahile kwitowa, wose wose tsa miya imwe na ishilini na wanane, chilongotsi wawo tsa Zabidieli mwana wa Hagedolimu. <verse eid="NEH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Na Walawi iwakalile kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu wawo awano, Shemaya kelekighwa na Hashubu, Hashubu kelekighwa na Azirikamu, Azirikamu kelekighwa na Hashabia, Hashabia kelekighwa na Buni. <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Shabetai na Yozabadi, pfilongotsi weli wa Walawi, iwemilile ng'onde tsa kunze mwa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Matania, yelekighwe na Mika, Mika kelekighwa na Zabidi, Zabidi kelekighwa na Asafu, iyawalongotse iwanu mna ukwimba na ukumlongela Imulungu mighede. Naye Bakibukia tsakamwapfila. Na Obadia kelekighwa na Shemaya, Shemaya kelekighwa na Galali, naye Galali kelekighwa na Yedutuni. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Na Walawi wose iwakalile mna ghumji ghwenzeluke ghwa Yerusalemu tsa miya mbili na semanini na wane. <verse eid="NEH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Na iwanu iwakalitse ghamalango iwakalile Yerusalumu tsa, Akubu, Talimoni na ndughu tsawo, wose tsa wanu miya imwe na sabini na weli. <verse eid="NEH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Na Waisiraeli wamwenga, hamwe na iwatambika na iwalawi tsawakala mna imiji yose ya Yuda, chila munu hanu hake. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Lekeni iwasang'ane mna ing'anda ya Imulungu tsawakala Yerusalemu hana ichidunda cha Ofeli, na wang'ali wolongotsighwa na Ziha na Gishipa.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Na chilingotsi wa Walawi iwakalile Yerusalemu wawo awano: Uzi yelekighwe na Bani, Bani yelekighwe na Hashabia, Hashabia yelekighwe na Matania, Matania yelekighwe na Mika iyolawa mna lukolo lwa Asafu. Iwanu wa lukolo aluno weng'ighwa ing'onde ya ukwimba mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Tsakuna laghitso kulawa kwa mfalume liwabamile wepangile mna chila tsuwa tsina nani wembe. <verse eid="NEH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Na Petahia, mwana wa Meshezabeli, iyolawa mna lukolo lwa Zera mna likabila lya Yuda yang'ali msenga wa mfalume mna ukutenda pfinu pfose pfa iwanu wa Yuda.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Isi tsingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Wanu wamwenga tsawakala mna imiji ili habehi na mighunda yawo, na wanu wamwenga wa likabila lya Yuda tsawakala Kiriati Ariba na pfijiji pfake na wakala Diboni na Yekabizeeli hamwe na kaye tsili habehi natso. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Pfipfila wamwenga tsawakala mna imiji ya Yeshua, Molada, na Beti Peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Hazarishuali, na Beeri Sheba na pfijiji pfili habehi. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Wamwenga wakala mna imiji ya Sikilagi, Mekona na pfijiji pfili habehi natso. <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Wamwenga wakala mna imji ya Enirimoni, Sora, Yarimuti, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Zanoa, Adulamu na pfijiji pfili habehi natso, wakala Lakishi na mighunda yake, na Azeka na kaye tsake. Apfo iwanu wa Yuda wakala haghati ha Beeri Sheba na ulwanda lwa Hinomu. <verse eid="NEH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Benjamini wakala Geba, Mikimashi, Aiya, Beteli na pfijiji pfake, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />wamwenga wakala Anathothi, Nobu, Anania <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hazori, Rama, Gitaimu, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadidi, Seboimu, Nebalati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lodi na Ono chikalile ulwanda lwa mafundi. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Na Walawi wamwenga wa Yuda tsawakala ako Benjamini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Iwatambika na Iwalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Awano wawo watambika na Walawi iwoyile kulawa akula kwawahamisighwe, hamwe na Zerubabeli mwana wa Shealitieli, na Yoshua,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraya, Yeremia, Ezra, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaria, Maluku, Hatushi, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekania, Rehumu, Meremoti, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido, Ginetoni, Abiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamini, Moadia, Biliga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya, Yoyaribu, Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu, Amoki, Hilikia na Yedaya. Awano tsawakala wakulu wa iwatambika na ndughu tsawo mna ghamatsuwa gha Yoshua hayawile mtambika mkulu.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Na Walawi iwoyile wawo awano: Yeshua, Binui, Kadimieli, Sherebia, Yuda na Matania, iyang'ali yolongotsa tsiwila tsa ukulonga mighende aku ndughu tsake womwapfila. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Nawo Bakibukia na Uno, hamwe na Walawi wangi iwang'ali wakwimagha welolesa na wayawo, hawakwimba kwa ukwidikila.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa mtambika mkulu Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yoshua kamweleka Yoyakimu, Yoyakimu kamweleka Eliashibu, Eliashibu kamweleka Yoyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada kamweleka Yonasani na Yonasani kamweleka Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa kolo tsa Watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha mtambika mkulu Yoyakimu, iwatambika awano tsawakala wakulu wa tsikolo, Meraya tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Seraya, Hanania tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Yeremia, <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Meshulum tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Ezra, Yehohanani tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Amaria, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Yonasani tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Maluki, na Yosefu tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Shebania, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adina tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Harimu, Helikai tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Meraioti, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zekaria tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Ido, Meshulamu tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Ginetoni, <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikiri tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Abiya, Piltai tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Moadia, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Biligai, Shamua tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Biligai, Yehonasani tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Shemaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenai tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Yoyaribu, Yedaya, Uzi tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalai tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Salu, Eberi tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Amoki, <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hashabia tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Hilikia, na Netaneli tsamkulu wa lukolo lwa Yedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa kaya tsa Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Wakulu wa kaya tsa Walawi, mna ghamatsuwa gha Eliashibu, Yoyada, Yohana, na Yadua, pfipfila na kolo tsa Watambika tsatsandikighwa mchitabu mna ghamatsuwa gha mfalume Dario wa Uajemi. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Wakulu wa tsikolo tsa Walawi nawo tsawandikighwa mna chitabu cha ukukumbuka mbaka mna matsuwa gha Yohanani mtsukulu wa Eliashibu.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwibokela tsisang'ano mna ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Na pfilongotsi wa Walawi tsawakala awano, Hashabia, Sherebia, Yeshua mwana wa Kadimieli na wayao, tsaweghola mna makingili meli iwang'ali wakwimba kwa ukwidikila wila tsa kumtunya na kumlongela mighede Imulungu akuno welolesa, ka pfayalagitse mfalume Daudi, imunu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Matania, Bakibukia, Obadia, Meshulamu, Talimoni na Akubu, wawo wang'ali wokalitsa tsikano itsikalile hana ghamalango. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Awano tsawasang'ana mna ghamatsuwa gha Yoyakimu, mwanaghe Yeshua mwana wa Yozadaki, na mna ghamatsuwa gha Nehemia iyawile mkulu wa isi, na mna ghamatsuwa gha Ezra, imtambika na iyamanyile ghoya ghamalaghitso.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemia koulapfa ubanda wa ghumji uwe wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Apfo hawang'ali woulapfa kwa Imulungu ubanda wa Yerusalemu, Walawi wabamighwa chila hanu kwawakalile na watsa wadeng'elele ukuulapfa ubanda kwa Imulungu, waulapfa kwa kudeng'elela, kwa kulonga mighede na kwa ukwimba na kwa ukutowa malati, pfimbeta, na pfing'weng'we. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Pfipfila iwanu iwakwimba wetingana hamwe kulawa ipfijiji pfose pfitsunguluke Yerusalemu na ipfijiji pfa Wanetofati, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />pfa Beti Giligali, pfa Geba, na pfijii pfa Azimaweti, kwaapfila iwanu iwakwimba tsawatsenga pfijiji pfawo mmbalimbali kutsunguluka Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Watambika na Walawi hawetendile wenyegho wele hambele ha Imulungu, pfipfila wawatenda iwanu wele, na ghamalango, na ubanda wele. <verse eid="NEH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Baho niwaghala wakulu wa Yuda mchanya mwa ubanda, walongotse makingili meli gha iwanu iwang'ali wakwimba wolonga mighede kwa Imulungu, aku welongotsa hamwe, mtingano ghumwe ghughenda ubali wa kujilo, kwalili Lilango lya Tsalala. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Naye Hoshaya kawawinza awo iwembile akuno kelongotsa na nusu ya pfilongotsi wano wa Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Na iwatambika awano aku wakinda tsimalati tawo tsawawinza, Azaria, Ezra, Meshulamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />na Yuda, Benjamini, Shemaya, Yeremia, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />na kelongotsa, Zekaria, yelekighwe na Yonasani, Yonasani yelekighwe na Shemaya, Shemaya yelekighwe na Matania, Matania yelekighwe na Mikaya, Mikaya yelekighwe na Zakuri, naye Zakuri yelekighwe na Asafu. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Na ndughu tsake awano tsawatowa ipfinu pfaukwimbila ka apfila pfayang'ali yotowagha mfalume Daudi, imunu wa Imulungu. Nawo wawo awano, Azareli, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Netaneli, Yuda na Hanani, naye mmanya malaghitso Ezra kawalongolela. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Na hana Lilango lya Mbwibwi wadina tsingatsi waghenda kwaghuli ghumji ghwa Daudi, waibita ing'anda ya Daudi mbaka kwalili Lilango lya Ghamatsi, ubali wa mashaliki. <verse eid="NEH 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Na likingili lya keli lya iwanu iwalongile mighede tsaghughenda ubali wa kumoso mchanya mwa ubanda, na nene niwawinza akuno nilongotsa na nusu ya iwanu. Tubita mnala ghwa Tanulu mbaka kuna Ubanda Mghatsi. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Na kulawa aho tubita hana Lilango lya Efuraimu, na hana Lilango lya Yeshana, Lilango lya Wasomba, hana Ghumnala ghwa Hananeli na hana Ghumnala ghwa Miya Imwe mbaka kune Lilango lya Wang'olo. Na ukwilongotsa kwetu kumalila hana Lilango lya Wabetetsi. <verse eid="NEH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Baho ghamakingili ghose meli ghe wila wa ukumlongela Imulungu mighede, tsaghema hana ing'anda ya Imulungu, hamwe na nene na inusu ya pfilongotsi. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Pfipfila na iwatambika awano nawo tsawatowa tsimalati tsawo, Eliakimu, Maaseya, Miniamini, Mikaya, Eliehoenai, Zekaria na Hanania, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Maaseya, Shemaya, Eleazari, Uzi, Yehohanani, Malikiya, Elamu na Ezeri, na awala iwakwimba tsawemba akuno wolongotsighwa na Yezirahia. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Tsuwa alyo walapfa nambiko nyingi, na wadeng'elela kwaapfila Imulungu tsakawatenda wawe na ndeng'elo ng'ulu. Pfiifila iwapinga na wana wose tsawadeng'elela. Ilukenze na imilutsi ya wanu kulawa Yerusalemu ihulikika kutali.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwiyandaa kwa ukulapfa ipfijo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Tsuwa alyo iwanu wasaghulighwa walolese pfiheleto ipfikala pfinu ipfilapfighwa kwa ing'anda ya Imulungu, pfijo pfa ukulimbula, fungu lya kumi,. iwanu wano tsaweng'ighwa ingonde ya ukukunga ipfijo kulawa kuna imighunda ili habei na tsikaye tsa iwatambika na tsa Walawi ka apfila ghamalaghitso pfaghobama. Kwaapfila Wayuda tsawawadeng'elela iwatambika na Walawi kwa kuwasang'anila. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Wawatenda iwanu wele hambele ha Imulungu wawo, na iwanu iwakwimba na iwokalitsa ghamalango nawo watenda pfipfo, ka pfayalaghitse mfalume Daudi na Selemani imwanaghe. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Kulawa ghumwande mna ghamatsuwa gha Daudi na Asafu, imunu iyadahile ukwimba, tsakukala na chilongotsi iyowalongotsa iwanu iwakwimba, na tsakuna na wila tsa ukumdeng'elela na tsakumlongela mighede Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Apfo mna ghamatsuwa Zerubabeli na Nehemia ghawakalile wagima, iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wang'ali wolapfa pfinu pfao chila tsuwa kuweng'a iwanu iwakwimba na iwokalitsa ghamalango. Iwanu pfipfila wang'ali wolapfa pfinu pfawo kwa Walawi, nawo Walawi wabaghula pfinu apfo kuwagholela iwana wa Haruni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wowobaghula iwanu wa Isi Tsingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Mna litsuwa alyo chitabu cha Musa chisomighwa kwa litsi kulu akuno iwanu wohulikitsa, honeka hanu hasomeke ka Waamoni na Wamoabu waleke ghendo kwingila mna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Kwaapfila wawo tsawawema Waisiraeli ghamatsi na ichijo, na tsawamhonga Balaamu yawalighite Waisiraeli, lekeni Imulungu wetu kaghalalusa malighito aghala ghawa balaka. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Baho iwanu wa Isiraeli hawahulike ghamalaghitso agho, wawabaghula iwanu wose iwali si Waisiraeli baye, wana iwahenga iwolawa isi tsingi.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumtambikila Imulungu kwakuya keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Aho ng'ana alino lilawile baye, mtambika Eliashibu tsakasaghulighwa yalolese pfiheleto pfa ukwikila ipfinu ipfili mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, naye tsasale yake mkulu Tobia. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Eliashibu tsakamleka Tobia yatumile ichiheleto chikulu, ghumwande wang'ali wakwikila tsinambiko tsa usaghe, tsa upfumba, tsa ipfinu, tsa itsaka ya ipfijo, itsaka ya idipfai, na itsaka ya ghamapfuta, pfawalaghitsighwe waweng'e Walawi, na iwanu iwakwimba, na awala iwokalitsa ghamalango, na ipfinu ipfilapfighwa kwa iwatambika. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Aghano haghang'ali ghotendeka, nene tsasili baho baye Yerusalaemu, kwaapfila mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na mbili ghwa mfalume Artashasta wa Babiloni tsambuya kwa mfalume, kuya hambele nimlomba mfalume mbuye keli Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Na hambuyile Yerusalemu mbona litotso lyayatendile Eliashibu kwa kumwing'a Tobia ichiheleto mmbalimbali mwa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Tsangudubuka ghendo na nyasa kunze pfinu pfose pfa Tobia ipfikalile mna ichiheleto. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Kuya niwalaghitsa iwanu wapfitende ipfiheleto pfele na nipfiyitsa ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu, hamwe na tsinambiko tsa ipfijo na upfumba.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Kuya mbona ghendo ka Walawi na iwanu iwakwimba, wana isang'ano ayo, ng'aweng'ighwe baye aghala ighobamighiwa weng'ighwe, apfo wose tsawoya kusang'ana mna imighunda yawo. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Baho niwamanila pfilongotsi, niwalonga, “Heule ing'anda ya Imulungu ilekighwe?” Apfo niwakema wose hamwe, na niweka chila munu mna ing'onde yake. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Kuya Wayuda wose wanza keli ukughala tsaka tsawo, tsinafaka, na idipfai, na ghamapfuta gha nzeituni kuna ipfiheleto. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Na niwasaghula iwanu awano waloleseghe ipfiheleto pfa ukwikila ipfinu, mtambika Shelamia, Zadoki, mlangulitsi wa malaghitso, na Pedaia Mlawi, na Hanani, mwanaghe Zakuri, na mwana wa Matania, yeye yang'ali yowapfila. Iwanu awano tsawatogholeka, na ing'onde yawo tsa ya ukuwagholela ndughu tsawo ipfinu. <verse eid="NEH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, ung'umbuke mna aghano ghose, wala uleke kughasemwa aghala ghose ghanendile kwa uluso wangu mna ing'anda ya Imulungu wangu na mna sang'ano tsake. <verse eid="NEH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Matsuwa ghagho niwona iwanu wa Yuda wokamla tsinzabibu mna litsuwa lya Sabato, kuya wamwenga wang'ali wowabapitsa wapfihongwe ingano, idipfai, nzabibu, na tini na pfinu pfingi, wopfighala Yerusalemu. Baho niwakembela waleke kuutsa ipfinu mna litsuwa alyo. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Pfipfila iwanu wa Tiro iwang'ali wokala Yerusalemu wang'ali woghala wasomba na pfinu pfingi na wang'ali wowautsila iwanu wa Yuda mumo Yerusalemu mna litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Kuya niwamanila pfilongotsi wa iwanu wa Yuda, niwalonga, “Angu chinu chachi achino ichihile chamtenda, ng'ambe mwoiligha Isabato? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Angu sekulu tsenu ng'awatendile ghaghano baye, mbaka wamtenda Imulungu kaghala ghamaghayo aghano ghose mna twetwe mna ghumji aghuno? Namwe mwoitenda imaya ya Imulungu yongetseke mna iwanu wa Isiraeli kwa kuiligha Isabato.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Apfo niwalaghitsa wahinde ghamalango gha Yerusalemu ahala Isabato haikwanza nemihe, na ichisi hachikwingila, na ghaleke kupfughulighwa mbaka Sabato haimala. Kuya niweka iwanu wangu hana ghamalango, ili walolese chileke kwingila chinu chochose mna litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Apfo wachulutsi iwang'ali woutsa ipfinu tsawawasa kunze mwa Yerusalemu kwa mala mbili au ndatu. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Lekeni niwakanya na niwalonga, “Heule muwasa hambele ha ubanda? Mng'atenda apfo keli, nitsowaghogha.” Kulawa ghamatsuwa agho ng'awatsile keli baye mna litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Kuya niwalaghitsa Walawi wetende wenyegho wele, na watse waikalitse ghamalango, ili litsuwa lya Sabato lienzeluke. Ghwe Mlungu wangu, ung'umbuke, na umbonele libatsi, ka pfauli ukulu wa uluso wako.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Kuya mna ghamatsuwa agho niwona Wayahudi iwakwelile mapinga wa Ashdodi, Amoni na Moabu, <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Na nusu ya iwana wawo tsawalonga Chiashidodi, na ng'awadahile baye kulonga Chiyahudi, lekeni tsawalonga lugha tsa iwanu wangi. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Nisonga nawo na niwalighita, na wamwenga wawo niwatowa na niwang'ola tsimvili tsawo, na niwananahitsa welahe kwa taghwa lya Imulungu, tsanonga, “Mleke kuwalapfa neghe tsenu wakwelighwe na iwana wao, wala neghe tsawo waleke kukwelighwa na iwana wenu.” <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Niwalongela, “Angu mfalume Selemani tsang'atendile nzambi baye kwa kukwela mapinga ka awano? Mna isi tsingi tsakuduhu mfalume ka yeye, naye Imulungu tsakamkunda sideke, na Imulungu kamtenda yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli yose. Lekeni mapinga wa isi tsingi wamtenda yatende nzambi. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Lelo pfihi tuwategheletse mwemwe, kwa kutenda ichinu achino chihile na kumtendela pfihile Imulungu wetu kwa kuwakwela mapinga wa isi tsingi?” <verse eid="NEH 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Mwana yumwe wa Yoyada, na iyali mtsukulu wa mtambika mkulu Eliashibu, tsakamkwela neghe Sanbalati Mhoroni, apfo nimuwinga yalawe Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Ghwe Imulungu wangu, uwakumbuke kwaapfila wautenda utambika wihe, na lilaghano lya watambika na lya walawi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Apfo niwatenda wele kulawa mna chinu chochose cha chigheni, kuya niweka iwatambika na Walawi mna tsisang'ano tsawo. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Kuya niwalaghitsa walapfeghe tsingodi na ipfijo pfawolimbula mna ghamatsuwa ighobamighwa. Ung'umbuke ghwe Imulungu wangu, ili unendele ghanoghile.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>